WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:13.000
Du hast erwähnt, dass Du viele Jahre Mitte-links gewählt hast. Wie blickst Du seit dem 7. Oktober auf Politik in Israel?

00:14.466 --> 00:16.966
Center-left, always center-left.

00:19.566 --> 00:24.666
I also had elections where I voted far left,

00:24.900 --> 00:26.800
"Peace Now" and all those.

00:27.233 --> 00:29.733
I used to be part of it.

00:30.266 --> 00:33.266
I still wish...

00:34.466 --> 00:38.366
you know, I had friends from there.

00:39.666 --> 00:42.300
There are great people on the other side.

00:42.300 --> 00:45.900
Some of them are really good people,

00:46.166 --> 00:49.166
and I really hope that it will be...

00:50.366 --> 00:54.566
we need to stop radical Islam.

00:55.466 --> 00:56.400
Because Islam and

00:56.400 --> 00:59.666
radical Islam are two different religions.

01:00.033 --> 01:03.066
And we just need to stop the radical Islamism

01:03.433 --> 01:05.900
around the Middle East, around this region.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.966
I have a problem with the left and right,

01:10.966 --> 01:13.900
because I think that the world has gone completely mad,

01:14.900 --> 01:17.000
today, if you’re

01:17.000 --> 01:20.000
right of Marx, you’re far right.

01:22.066 --> 01:25.000
I think that people have to understand one thing:

01:26.000 --> 01:27.000
Once...

01:31.600 --> 01:34.133
Once survival is on the line,

01:35.066 --> 01:38.333
all that philosophy is flushed down the drain.

01:39.233 --> 01:41.500
When people

01:41.966 --> 01:43.433
are aiming

01:43.433 --> 01:45.566
weapons towards your children

01:45.966 --> 01:48.366
and coming and slaughtering

01:48.966 --> 01:51.333
so many of your friends...

01:53.200 --> 01:56.266
So many of the Israelis changed their minds,

01:56.666 --> 02:00.400
and we were even laughed at because we were

02:00.400 --> 02:03.066
the stronghold of the left, they said:

02:03.066 --> 02:04.400
"You see how naive you are",

02:04.400 --> 02:06.566
"You gave them jobs you gave them ...",

02:07.500 --> 02:10.100
So what it actually did was

02:10.100 --> 02:15.200
make the left side in Israel less strong.

02:22.566 --> 02:23.966
It’s a problem.

02:23.966 --> 02:27.500
When you are dealing with a terror organization,

02:27.500 --> 02:30.266
when you are fighting against guerrilla groups,

02:30.266 --> 02:34.466
it’s completely different than what we are

02:35.433 --> 02:36.533
used to.
